## 1. What will you set up?

Use this section to test a feature from your first local run through its completed device-test result. The shared example is **placing a chicken order in My Chicken App**.

**Start with:** an application that already runs on your Mac, its approved dependencies, and access to its test configuration. Complete [Machine Setup](/mobile/onboarding/machine-setup-guide/) first if needed.

You will write tests, run them locally, configure the required coverage checks, and connect prepared device tests to the approved Bitrise workflow. Keep changes in the existing application repository.

