## 2. Copy the implementation and tests for your platform

Follow this order within your platform tab:

1. Add the sample service only if you are using this isolated learning fixture. For an existing feature, test its real use case through controlled dependencies.
2. Add unit tests to the unit-test target and run them.
3. Connect the screen to the approved fixture and expose the identifiers in section 3.
4. Add the native UI test and run it on a local test target.
5. Prepare matching application/test packages, then follow the Sauce Labs guide.

Retain one service instance for the active order flow. The service blocks overlapping calls only; the feature's state owner must also prevent replay after an unknown result. Currency formatting belongs to the app's approved money/locale model.

